OL,12,G0000 Asian Network Trending
OL,13,     FFor generations, many South Asians
OL,14,     Fexpected to live with their
OL,15,     Fparents until marriage. But with
OL,16,     Fhouse prices and rent rising, what
OL,17,     Fdoes living with mum and dad look
OL,18,     Flike in 2026?
